## Reference Implementation

- **Blade**: `modules/TreatmentReservation/Resources/views/admin/reservations/partials/dashboard/kpi-card.blade.php`
- **SCSS**: `modules/TreatmentReservation/Resources/assets/admin/sass/_dashboard-crm.scss` — search `.tr-crm-kpi`

## Usage Notes

- Use CSS class prefix appropriate to the module (e.g. `tr-crm-kpi` for TreatmentReservation, `fc-saas-stat` for Admin dashboard)
- Always include hover lift effect and colored border per variant
- Font: Plus Jakarta Sans (already loaded globally)
- Grid: `repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr))` or `repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr))` for 4-column layouts
